### Canvas: all courses that have assignments
GET http://localhost:8084/canvas/kurser
Accept: application/json

### Canvas: assignments for D0031N
GET http://localhost:8084/canvas/kurser/D0031N/uppgifter
Accept: application/json

### Lowercase course code also works
GET http://localhost:8084/canvas/kurser/d0031n/uppgifter
Accept: application/json

### Unknown course gives an empty list
GET http://localhost:8084/canvas/kurser/X9999X/uppgifter
Accept: application/json

### Canvas: students on assignment 1 in D0031N
GET http://localhost:8084/canvas/kurser/D0031N/uppgifter/1/studenter
Accept: application/json

### Assignment that doesn't exist gives 404
GET http://localhost:8084/canvas/kurser/D0031N/uppgifter/999/studenter
Accept: application/json

### Assignment in another course gives 404
GET http://localhost:8084/canvas/kurser/D0024E/uppgifter/1/studenter
Accept: application/json